OL,4,BLeicester no longer for sale as owner  
OL,5,Brefocuses on future                    
OL,6,GLeicester City owner Khun Aiyawatt     
OL,7,G'Top' Srivaddhanaprabha has confirmed  
OL,8,Gthe one-time Premier League title      
OL,9,Gwinners are no longer up for sale and  
OL,10,Gthere will be a "refocus" on           
OL,11,Grebuilding the side after years of     
OL,12,Gdecline.                               
OL,14,FThe Foxes were put on the market in    
OL,15,Fthe summer after back-to-back          
OL,16,Frelegations saw the side drop from the 
OL,17,FPremier League and straight through    
OL,18,Fthe Championship to land in England's  
OL,19,Fthird tier for just the second time in 
OL,20,Fthe club's 142-year history.           
